<title>UK: Cedel Bank to reduce safekeeping fees from Nov 1.</title>
<headline>Cedel Bank to reduce safekeeping fees from Nov 1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cedel Bank will reduce safekeeping fees for all customers from November 1 this year, the Cedel Group said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It will also reduce marginal safekeeping rates as securities deposits increase and reduce the delivery fee.</p>
<p>It will introduce a new receipt fee for internal and bridge transactions, the statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;...we are passing on the benefits of economies of scale, via reduced safekeeping fees...,&quot; customer services and marketing executive director Carlos Salvatori said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
